[{"title":"偈颂二十三首 其十五","author":"释云岫","text":"如来藏中有一常圆之月，大如车轮，冷如冰雪，犀牛扇子何曾别。\n怒涛推出海，恰值中秋节。\n若也唤作白莲花，浮出龙王宫。\n我道玉川子，胡说乱说。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6739,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十三首 其十四","author":"释云岫","text":"荡尽是非窠窟，截断葛藤露布。\n今日放开布袋，不要东去西去。\n拗折拄杖，向者里住。\n碧眼胡僧坐九年，心胆浑如生铁铸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6740,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十三首 其十二","author":"释云岫","text":"千岩带雪，万水生冰。\n今夜寒极岁极，明朝日新月新。\n山僧禅床角头拂子，长时间挂不犯纤尘。\n信手拈来，春回大地。\n展慈容于释迦老子，收怒气于金刚眼睛。\n只者一著，最妙最灵。\n今正是时，如何委悉，浩浩尘中寻不见，见无见处却分明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6741,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十三首 其十一","author":"释云岫","text":"一句子，玄中玄，妙中妙。\n寒暑不相干，阴阳不相到，必竟如何通耗。\n鹭鸶立雪非同色，明月芦花不似他。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6742,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十三首 其十","author":"释云岫","text":"蟋蟀啼坏墙，虾蟆叫春水。\n时节使之然，处处聒人耳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6743,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十三首 其九","author":"释云岫","text":"左顾右盻，皆我良辅。\n云生兮从龙，风生兮从虎。\n山僧坐绳床说禅，按拄杖作主。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6744,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十三首 其八","author":"释云岫","text":"曙色才分鸡便唱，春风未动鸟先啼。\n一床胡蝶家家梦，祖意无人肯入思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6745,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十三首 其七","author":"释云岫","text":"西风凋木叶，蟋蟀啼坏墙。\n明月照破屋，露冷黄金床。\n藏经一卷，儒书一章。\n读不成句，书不成行，天空地阔谁商量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6746,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十三首 其五","author":"释云岫","text":"半夜劈破太空，太阳正照白昼。\n掩却万象生铁一团，二俱列下别有商量。\n南海观音菩萨，端坐水月道场。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6747,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十三首 其四","author":"释云岫","text":"昆崙之水易发，少林之春难芳。\n一臂忽断，九年顿忘。\n雷晕纹于象齿，花酿蜜于蜂房。\n派列枝分兮子孙繁碎，乌非马似兮言语文章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6748,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十三首 其三","author":"释云岫","text":"久渴逢甘雨，他乡见故知。\n洞房花烛夜，金榜状元归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6749,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十三首 其二","author":"释云岫","text":"大觉世尊，腊月八夜，子正四刻，睹明星而悟道。\n引得后代儿孙，夜半染皂。\n智门昨夜伤风，打嚏凑得恰好。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6750,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十三首 其一","author":"释云岫","text":"夜半金乌出，寥寥照寰宇。\n两眼对青山，通身泪如雨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6751,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄五师北山讲主","author":"释云岫","text":"一书不问不相违，指迹慕归谁救迟。\n莺脰湖边官驿路，舟车十里到凫矶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6752,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄东禅宗周讲主","author":"释云岫","text":"四海六民皆走利，东禅讲主只谭禅。\n何年去住灵山寺，招我岩间看白?。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6753,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄兰屋府教","author":"释云岫","text":"入门便有湘江意，数米幽香见屈原。\n萧艾若教同一色，清标不在座中看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6754,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄同源师兄归受业","author":"释云岫","text":"松菊吹香满旧篱，借人屋住不如归。\n胸中岂是无韬略，袖手棋边看著棋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6755,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄西野先生","author":"释云岫","text":"西野先生是旧知，六年相聚不相违。\n松根石上閒追忆，君子当今更有谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6756,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄保宁无门讲主","author":"释云岫","text":"锦障桃花春色里，白衣雪屋月明中。\n此时此意无人会，海上仙山第一峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6757,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄虚室和尚","author":"释云岫","text":"共住西山一片云，朝昏钟磬亦相闻。\n天台南岳当时事，彼彼情怀未得论。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6758,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄象山万松检察诸昆季","author":"释云岫","text":"丹桂联芳贵一门，往来时得细论文。\n青黄又见三年别，望白岩山海气昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6759,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄象田斗山和尚","author":"释云岫","text":"长翁留得灵苗别，不似将禾唤作禾。\n腊雪喜呈三度白，丰年谶在象田多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6760,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄象田昙藏主","author":"释云岫","text":"迢迢西望越山青，水宿山行是几程。\n为忆象耕遗迹事，劳心虽苦未劳形。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6761,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼东皋友山和尚","author":"释云岫","text":"握空拳建东皋寺，一饭饱多云水僧。\n身死百年曾未减，数珠牙齿放光明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6762,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼栖真古帆和尚","author":"释云岫","text":"高梧枝折凤皇飞，山色凝愁似死灰。\n惆怅暮春风雨暗，百禽多噪闹芳菲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6763,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答法华东洲和尚","author":"释云岫","text":"干戈倒用识安危，方便垂慈接个谁。\n每每见僧陪面笑，祖师门户放教低。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6764,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢天童和尚相访","author":"释云岫","text":"长者车来草舍荣，黄童白叟悉皆惊。\n一香未得谢临屈，廿里松云入梦青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6765,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遥礼乌山东叟和尚塔","author":"释云岫","text":"拙口无言心自知，对人垂泪湿禅衣。\n如今欲说当时事，塔在乌山不见师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6766,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题宣侍者行卷","author":"释云岫","text":"曾携铁网入沧海，裹得珊瑚树一株。\n莺脰湖边轻借看，十分光彩照吾庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6767,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题梓岩和尚吟卷","author":"释云岫","text":"字字不因容易得，灯花曾落五更钟。\n东湖浪阔瓶声远，流出一溪霜叶风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6768,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归山","author":"释云林","text":"沧海尘生望不还，虚空粉碎步方艰。\n时人欲识今行履，一衲萧然云岭间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6769,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答友","author":"释云林","text":"搔首何须更问天，此心灰尽不重然。\n休将琐琐尘寰事，换我山中枕石眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6770,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"邺公庵歌","author":"释云知","text":"呼猿涧西藏石笋，丹桂苍松达鹫岭。\n几年陈迹绝纤埃，一旦佳名同清景。\n山家时喜来五马，相携款曲空岩下。\n遂许诛茅结小庵，异日功成伴潇洒。\n庵成可以资静观，目前直见江湖宽。\n邺公政简每频到，试茶笑傲浮云端。\n物外似忘轩冕贵，此中深得林泉意。\n野人陪著病维摩，游息自同方丈地。\n芳猷从此流千载，且得而今光胜概。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6771,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其二十","author":"释昙贲","text":"七宝杯酌葡萄酒，金花纸写清平词。\n春风院静无人见，闲把君王玉笛吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6772,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其十九","author":"释昙贲","text":"冰棱锁断长河口，不见人从鸟道来。\n一阵风回脩竹里，玉阑干上雪成堆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6773,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其十八","author":"释昙贲","text":"血盆似口剑如牙，竭世枢机未足誇。\n亲到龙潭龙不现，者回失却眼中花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6774,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其四","author":"释云贲","text":"驴前马后识灵云，满眼风埃绝点尘。\n行偏天台并雁荡，归来重看锦江春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6775,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其五","author":"释云贲","text":"信手挥来一一亲，祗林剑下绝烟尘。\n太平曲调无人会，孤负皇家定乱人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6776,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其十六","author":"释昙贲","text":"蒙头不觉齁齁睡，开眼从教燄燄红。\n若谓平常便无事，须防豆爆冷灰中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6777,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其十三","author":"释昙贲","text":"以何为体呵呵笑，推倒当头陷虎机。\n鸟带香从花里出，龙含雨向洞中归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6778,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其八","author":"释云贲","text":"芙蓉月向怀中照，杨柳风来面上吹。\n夜半庭前柘枝舞，天明罗袖湿胭脂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6779,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其十二","author":"释昙贲","text":"一足垂来亲点眼，岭头功德已圆成。\n长髭只怕精神露，却指红炉片雪轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6780,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其十一","author":"释昙贲","text":"风月山川共一家，谁来语下定龙蛇。\n太白不曾登便殿，笔头昨夜自生花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6781,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其十","author":"释昙贲","text":"认得斑斑急上弦，吼风一镞去惊天。\n近前子细来观觑，谁把蓝田石射穿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6782,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其六","author":"释昙贲","text":"截断从教来衮衮，随流未必去滔滔。\n青山长锁欲飞势，沧海合知来处高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6783,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其二","author":"释昙贲","text":"刹刹尘尘见不难，头陀何苦被他瞒。\n当初若论收奸细，莫把瞿昙做佛看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6784,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其一","author":"释昙贲","text":"两手擎来教放下，空身立地更疑猜。\n根尘识界无寻处，多谢春风烂漫开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6785,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其二十五","author":"释昙贲","text":"一雨一阴风未和，春从不快里消磨。\n桃花暗已随流水，空使刘郎惆怅多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6786,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其二十四","author":"释昙贲","text":"牙根烂嚼真弥勒，腹里横吞老释迦。\n大地虚空皆得饱，这回不到负檀家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6787,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其二十二","author":"释昙贲","text":"脱得边城戍役身，却来偷赏上园春。\n御街前畔低声语，不觉冲他貌事人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6788,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其二","author":"释昙贲","text":"闹篮方喜得抽头，退鼓而今打未休。\n莫把乳峰千丈雪，重来换我一双眸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6789,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈四首 其四","author":"释昙贲","text":"浓将红粉傅了面，满把真珠盖却头。\n不识佳人真面目，空教人唱小凉州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6790,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其二十一","author":"释昙贲","text":"白牯问狸奴，虚空酬万象。\n电激不停踪，谷虚谁答响。\n啐兮啄兮，清机历掌。\n回头?轹范秦时，舌上葛藤长万丈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6791,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其十五","author":"释昙贲","text":"指点深红与昔同，更无夭艳在芳丛。\n南泉笑里移春去，留得残红醉蜜蜂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6792,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其十四","author":"释昙贲","text":"黄鹤楼前题一篇，无限措大失平仄。\n长沙一只眼长长，今古何曾有踪迹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6793,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其二十三","author":"释云贲","text":"两指爪开权撮起，一志头上为吹开。\n这回不在身边立，休说清风偏九垓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6794,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其五","author":"释昙贲","text":"映林映日一般红，吹落吹开总是风。\n可惜撷芳人不见，一时分付与游蜂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6795,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其二十三","author":"释昙贲","text":"水不洗水，金不博金。\n昧毛色而得马，靡丝弦而乐琴。\n结绳画卦有许事，丧尽真淳盘古心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6796,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古四首 其四","author":"释昙贲","text":"明宣一道聪明咒，暗写两行灵宝符。\n谩道骑鲸游六合，何曾有梦到华胥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6797,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古四首 其三","author":"释昙贲","text":"带雪含霜半倚篱，横斜影里露仙姿。\n前村昨夜春来了，竹屋老僧犹未知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6798,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古四首 其二","author":"释昙贲","text":"婆子因行掉臂，赵州因事长智。\n无端一句淆沎，惹得四海鼎沸。\n勘破了，有谁知。\n春风过后无消息，留得残花一两枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6799,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古四首 其一","author":"释昙贲","text":"竿头崖头撒手去，阆州澧州寻路归。\n廉纤脱尽全机露，八角磨盘空里飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6800,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其一","author":"释昙贲","text":"一见便见，八角磨盘空里转。\n一得永得，辰锦朱砂如墨黑。\n秋风吹渭水，已落云门三句里。\n落叶满长安，几个而今被眼瞒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6801,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈四首 其二","author":"释昙贲","text":"维摩病，说尽道理。\n龙翔病，咳嗽不已。\n咳嗽不已，说尽道理。\n说尽道理，咳嗽不已。\n本是长江凑风冷，却教露柱患头风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6802,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈四首 其三","author":"释昙贲","text":"团圞擘不破，潇洒觑不见。\n唤作正法眼，入地狱如箭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6803,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈四首 其一","author":"释昙贲","text":"五百生中受屈，祇缘不识个落字。\n百千众中较量，祇缘不识个昧字。\n都来两字淆讹，陷却多少平直。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6804,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼落牙","author":"释昙贲","text":"汝从何所来，遁迹在我口。\n美恶必同尝，冷暖共知有。\n我口时动摇，汝体常坚守。\n夫何一病缠，遽落钳匠手。\n汝今先我徂，我在嗟无后。\n坚者既不留，软者岂能久。\n平生敲磕句，一一如雷吼。\n嚼破百弥卢，咬断众窼臼。\n我力既若是，汝形安得朽。\n无生复无离，庶洗言说咎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6805,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十七首 其三","author":"释昙贲","text":"六月上伏，八月中秋。\n人平不语，水平不流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6806,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"辞众偈","author":"释云豁","text":"天不高，地不厚，自是时人觑不透。\n但看腊月二十五，依旧面南看北斗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6807,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"释从垣","text":"杜宇一声苍树远，黄鹂三啭落花深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6808,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"释从垣","text":"泉石天象转，花月地痕虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6809,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"释从垣","text":"□尽榆钱犹案价，晚风门外落桐花。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6810,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"释从垣","text":"吟诗已得池塘梦，学易独明天地心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6811,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"释从垣","text":"习字带秋收柿叶，学诗和月咽梅花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6812,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"释从垣","text":"□踏浪□知浪险，蝶翻花宅惜花空。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6813,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归寂颂","author":"释从朗","text":"三十年来住木陈，时中无一假功成。\n有人问我西来意，展似眉毛作么生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":6814,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]